OL,3,ACharles said Diana would be forgotten
OL,4,A'soon enough', Earl Spencer claims in
OL,5,Abook
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson said: "While we do not
OL,8,Fcomment on books as a matter of
OL,9,Fprinciple, His Majesty is mindful that
OL,10,Fthe pain of fraternal grief can cloud
OL,11,Freason, affect judgment and colour
OL,12,Fmemory in ways others do not recognise,
OL,13,Feven many years after such a loss."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
